  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-04-07T10:00:37.801Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "There is a specification that kick voting cannot be initiated if everyone is blocked prior to a particular malicious user in the instance.\n\nFor example, if a user is using cheats in the game world, the kick cannot be initiated, making it impossible to continue.\n\nIt is also possible for multiple people to hijack an instance using the same technique.\n\nPlease help me improve this issue. (Specifically, I would like to be able to kick vote even if a large number of people are blocked ahead of time. This can be abused.)",
